  "description": {
    "format": "nuke_help_html",
    "plain_text": "TimeBlur: Runs the input at fractional times centered around the current frame and then average the results together, to add motion blur to the operators. You should insert a NoTimeBlend operator earlier in the script to surround the portion you actually want to TimeBlur.",
    "source": "nuke.Node.help()",
    "text": "TimeBlur:\nRuns the input at fractional times centered around the current frame and then average the results together, to add motion blur to the operators. You should insert a NoTimeBlend operator earlier in the script to surround the portion you actually want to TimeBlur."
